{"id":"n66971-1-9","stage":2,"title":"약도 · 略图","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66971-1-9-1","ko":"처음 가 보는 길인데 괜찮을까?","zh":"这是我第一次走这条路，没问题吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"처음","meaning":"第一次，初次","explanation":"처음：第一次，初次。","readings":[{"term":"처음","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17170","senseId":"1","lemma":"처음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"처음","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3"}},{"text":"가","meaning":"走","explanation":"가다：走；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"13","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가","audio":"/audio/64ee5293d31bc58b72d7.mp3"}},{"text":"보는","meaning":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보는","audio":"/audio/8103e7fed907b17e57e3.mp3"}},{"text":"길인데","meaning":"路，道，道路","explanation":"길：路，道，道路；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"1","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"길인데","audio":"/audio/14d336520997567d1b96.mp3"}},{"text":"괜찮을까?","meaning":"无恙，没事","explanation":"괜찮다：无恙，没事；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"2","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괜찮을까","audio":"/audio/790c7f97f9710a0d5e22.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"91390eadfad43d09","term":"처음","zh":"第一次，初次","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3","entryId":"17170","definition":"在顺序或时间上排在